                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg845">p. 845</ref>,
                    states that during the morning Roosevelt received Norman Robertson, the Canadian
                    Under Secretary for External Affairs. No record of the discussion has been
                    found.</p>
            </div>
